Hi {Owner},

I build websites for house cleaning companies around {City}. {Business Name} has great reviews, but someone who finds you tonight can't see a price or book a clean without calling.

I built a sample first instead of asking for your time: a price list by bedroom and bathroom count, what each clean includes, weekly and biweekly plans, and a booking page, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
